#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitor a job {#monitor-a-job}"
msgstr "Pantau kerja {#monitor-a-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use these methods to check the status of your submitted jobs, retrieve results, and view details related to the job and its execution.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan kaedah ini untuk menyemak status kerja yang anda hantar, mendapatkan semula keputusan, dan melihat butiran berkaitan kerja tersebut dan pelaksanaannya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Monitor a job with Qiskit\">\n"
"        The job instance provides several methods for monitoring:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Pantau kerja dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Instans kerja menyediakan beberapa kaedah untuk pemantauan:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        | Method | Description |\n"
"        | --- | --- |\n"
"        | `job.status()` | Check the current job status |\n"
"        | `job.job_id()` | Get the unique job identifier |\n"
"        | `job.result()` | Retrieve job results (blocking call until complete) |\n"
"        | `job.wait_for_final_state()` | Block until the job reaches a terminal state |\n"
msgstr ""
"        | Method | Description |\n"
"        | --- | --- |\n"
"        | `job.status()` | Check the current job status |\n"
"        | `job.job_id()` | Get the unique job identifier |\n"
"        | `job.result()` | Retrieve job results (blocking call until complete) |\n"
"        | `job.wait_for_final_state()` | Block until the job reaches a terminal state |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Monitor a job on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Navigate to the [Workloads page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) and check the Status column. Your job status appears as one of the following:\n"
"        - **Pending**: Job is waiting to run on a QPU\n"
"        - **In progress**: Job is currently executing\n"
"        - **Completed**: Job finished successfully\n"
"        - **Failed**: Job encountered an error\n"
"        - **Canceled**: User canceled the job\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Pantau kerja pada IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Navigasi ke [halaman Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) dan semak lajur Status. Status kerja anda akan muncul sebagai salah satu daripada berikut:\n"
"        - **Pending**: Kerja sedang menunggu untuk dijalankan pada QPU\n"
"        - **In progress**: Kerja sedang dilaksanakan\n"
"        - **Completed**: Kerja selesai dengan jayanya\n"
"        - **Failed**: Kerja mengalami ralat\n"
"        - **Canceled**: Pengguna membatalkan kerja\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        Click on the job name or row to open the detailed view, where you can see information such as the results and any error messages.\n"
msgstr "        Klik pada nama kerja atau baris untuk membuka paparan terperinci, di mana anda boleh melihat maklumat seperti keputusan dan sebarang mesej ralat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why a job stays \"In progress\" {#why-a-job-stays-in-progress}"
msgstr "Mengapa kerja kekal \"In progress\" {#why-a-job-stays-in-progress}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You might notice that a job (using either job mode or batch mode) you expect to take only a few seconds stays in the **In progress** status (called `RUNNING` in Qiskit) for much longer. This is normal, and it does not mean the job is consuming that entire time as usage. It happens because of how jobs are scheduled onto a QPU:\n"
msgstr "Anda mungkin perasan bahawa kerja (menggunakan sama ada mod kerja atau mod kumpulan) yang anda jangkakan hanya mengambil masa beberapa saat kekal pada status **In progress** (dipanggil `RUNNING` dalam Qiskit) untuk tempoh yang lebih lama. Ini adalah normal, dan ia tidak bermakna kerja tersebut menggunakan keseluruhan masa itu sebagai penggunaan. Ini berlaku disebabkan cara kerja dijadualkan pada QPU:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every job requires classical pre-processing before it can run on the QPU. A job moves to **In progress** (`RUNNING`) as soon as this classical processing begins — not when it starts executing on the QPU.\n"
msgstr "Setiap kerja memerlukan pra-pemprosesan klasik sebelum ia boleh berjalan pada QPU. Kerja beralih ke **In progress** (`RUNNING`) sebaik sahaja pemprosesan klasik ini bermula — bukan apabila ia mula dilaksanakan pada QPU.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most of this classical processing runs in parallel, so multiple jobs can be **In progress** at the same time.\n"
msgstr "Kebanyakan pemprosesan klasik ini berjalan secara selari, jadi beberapa kerja boleh berada dalam status **In progress** pada masa yang sama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "However, only one job at a time can run on the QPU. When several jobs finish their classical processing and are ready to execute, they must wait their turn for the QPU. This is known as *QPU contention*. When contention is high, a job can remain **In progress** noticeably longer than the few seconds of QPU time it actually needs.\n"
msgstr "Walau bagaimanapun, hanya satu kerja pada satu masa boleh berjalan pada QPU. Apabila beberapa kerja menyelesaikan pemprosesan klasik mereka dan bersedia untuk dilaksanakan, mereka perlu menunggu giliran untuk QPU. Ini dikenali sebagai *pertikaian QPU*. Apabila pertikaian tinggi, kerja boleh kekal pada **In progress** dengan ketara lebih lama daripada beberapa saat masa QPU yang sebenarnya diperlukan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contention can also occur when a system-maintenance task, such as calibration, is running on the QPU. Your job stays **In progress** until the maintenance task completes and the QPU becomes available.\n"
msgstr "Pertikaian juga boleh berlaku apabila tugas penyelenggaraan sistem, seperti kalibrasi, sedang dijalankan pada QPU. Kerja anda kekal pada **In progress** sehingga tugas penyelenggaraan itu selesai dan QPU tersedia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because of this, the elapsed wall-clock time a job spends **In progress** is not the same as its usage. Both the [estimated usage](/guides/estimate-job-run-time) and the [maximum execution time](/guides/max-execution-time) are based only on the time the QPU is locked to execute your job, and therefore exclude the multi-threaded classical processing described above. A long **In progress** time does not increase your reported usage or cost.\n"
msgstr "Disebabkan ini, masa jam-dinding yang berlalu yang dihabiskan oleh kerja pada **In progress** tidak sama dengan penggunaannya. Kedua-dua [anggaran penggunaan](/guides/estimate-job-run-time) dan [masa pelaksanaan maksimum](/guides/max-execution-time) hanya berdasarkan masa QPU dikunci untuk melaksanakan kerja anda, dan oleh itu tidak termasuk pemprosesan klasik berbenang-berbilang yang diterangkan di atas. Masa **In progress** yang lama tidak meningkatkan penggunaan atau kos yang dilaporkan.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Session mode is different {#session-mode-is-different}"
msgstr "Mod Session adalah berbeza {#session-mode-is-different}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The preceding behavior applies to [job mode](/guides/execution-modes#job-mode) and [batch mode](/guides/execution-modes#batch-mode). In [session mode](/guides/execution-modes#session-mode), during the session's active window, the user has exclusive access to the backend and no other jobs can run, including calibration jobs. Therefore, any QPU contention happens only among your own session jobs. In addition, because QPU capacity is reserved for the duration of the session, session usage is measured as the elapsed time while the session remains active, regardless of whether jobs are actively running. See [Workload usage](/guides/estimate-job-run-time#usage) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Tingkah laku sebelumnya berlaku untuk [mod kerja](/guides/execution-modes#job-mode) dan [mod kumpulan](/guides/execution-modes#batch-mode). Dalam [mod Session](/guides/execution-modes#session-mode), semasa tetingkap aktif Session, pengguna mempunyai akses eksklusif kepada Backend dan tiada kerja lain boleh berjalan, termasuk kerja kalibrasi. Oleh itu, sebarang pertikaian QPU hanya berlaku antara kerja Session anda sendiri. Selain itu, kerana kapasiti QPU dikhaskan untuk tempoh Session, penggunaan Session diukur sebagai masa berlalu semasa Session kekal aktif, tanpa mengira sama ada kerja sedang dijalankan secara aktif. Lihat [Penggunaan beban kerja](/guides/estimate-job-run-time#usage) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "View remaining usage {#view-remaining-usage}"
msgstr "Lihat baki penggunaan {#view-remaining-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Track how much of your plan's usage quota remains.\n"
msgstr "Jejaki berapa banyak kuota penggunaan pelan anda yang tinggal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Check usage with Qiskit\">\n"
"        Use the `service.usage()` method to get usage information for your current active instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Semak penggunaan dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Gunakan kaedah `service.usage()` untuk mendapatkan maklumat penggunaan bagi instans aktif anda semasa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"View usage on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Navigate to the [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) and select the tab associated with the plan you want to check. The total time used and total time remaining on your plan is displayed.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Lihat penggunaan pada IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Navigasi ke [halaman Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) dan pilih tab yang berkaitan dengan pelan yang anda ingin semak. Jumlah masa yang digunakan dan jumlah masa yang tinggal pada pelan anda akan dipaparkan.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "View job metrics {#view-job-metrics}"
msgstr "Lihat metrik kerja {#view-job-metrics}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get an overview of your job submissions, including batch and session workload metrics.\n"
msgstr "Dapatkan gambaran keseluruhan penghantaran kerja anda, termasuk metrik beban kerja kumpulan dan Session.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Get job metrics with Qiskit\">\n"
"        Use the [`service.jobs()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs)  method with filters to retrieve information about your submitted jobs, such as how many have been submitted, what their statuses are, and when they were created. The following example retrieves all jobs submitted in the last seven days and calculates the total usage from those jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Dapatkan metrik kerja dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Gunakan kaedah [`service.jobs()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) dengan penapis untuk mendapatkan semula maklumat tentang kerja yang anda hantar, seperti berapa banyak yang telah dihantar, apakah status mereka, dan bila ia dicipta. Contoh berikut mendapatkan semula semua kerja yang dihantar dalam tujuh hari lepas dan mengira jumlah penggunaan daripada kerja tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"View job metrics on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Navigate to the [Analytics page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) to see and download data, such as the following:\n"
"        - Total usage\n"
"        - Usage filtered by instance, quantum computer, and user\n"
"        - Count of job, batch, and session workloads\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Lihat metrik kerja pada IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Navigasi ke [halaman Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) untuk melihat dan memuat turun data, seperti berikut:\n"
"        - Jumlah penggunaan\n"
"        - Penggunaan ditapis mengikut instans, komputer kuantum, dan pengguna\n"
"        - Kiraan beban kerja kerja, kumpulan, dan Session\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        **Note**: You can only access the Analytics page for accounts that you own or manage.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"        **Nota**: Anda hanya boleh mengakses halaman Analytics untuk akaun yang anda miliki atau uruskan.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve job results at a later time {#retrieve-job-results-at-a-later-time}"
msgstr "Dapatkan semula keputusan kerja pada masa kemudian {#retrieve-job-results-at-a-later-time}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can save job IDs and retrieve results later, even after closing your session.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menyimpan ID kerja dan mendapatkan semula keputusan kemudian, walaupun selepas menutup Session anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Retrieve results with Qiskit\">\n"
"        If you saved the job ID when you submitted the job, use `service.job(<job_id>)` to retrieve it later. If you don't have the job ID, or if you want to retrieve multiple jobs at once (including jobs from retired QPUs), use `service.jobs()` instead, with optional filters.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Dapatkan semula keputusan dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Jika anda menyimpan ID kerja semasa anda menghantar kerja, gunakan `service.job(<job_id>)` untuk mendapatkannya semula kemudian. Jika anda tidak mempunyai ID kerja, atau jika anda ingin mendapatkan semula beberapa kerja sekali gus (termasuk kerja daripada QPU yang telah dinyahaktifkan), gunakan `service.jobs()` sebaliknya, dengan penapis pilihan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        See the [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) API documentation for available filters.\n"
msgstr "        Lihat dokumentasi API [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) untuk penapis yang tersedia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        This example demonstrates retrieving recent results run on a specific backend.\n"
msgstr "        Contoh ini menunjukkan cara mendapatkan semula keputusan terkini yang dijalankan pada Backend tertentu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Retrieve results on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        1. Go to the [Workloads page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"
"        2. Use the search or filter options to find your job by name, date, or status.\n"
"        3. Click on the job to view its results and details.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Dapatkan semula keputusan pada IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        1. Pergi ke [halaman Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"
"        2. Gunakan pilihan carian atau penapis untuk mencari kerja anda mengikut nama, tarikh, atau status.\n"
"        3. Klik pada kerja untuk melihat keputusan dan butirannya.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve backend properties {#retrieve-backend-properties}"
msgstr "Dapatkan semula ciri Backend {#retrieve-backend-properties}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Retrieve backend properties with Qiskit\">\n"
"        You can use `job.properties()` to retrieve backend properties, including error rates, at the time of the job execution.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Dapatkan semula ciri Backend dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Anda boleh menggunakan `job.properties()` untuk mendapatkan semula ciri Backend, termasuk kadar ralat, pada masa pelaksanaan kerja.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        This example demonstrates how to retrieve backend properties that were current at the time a job was executed, including $T_1$/$T_2$ times and error rates for a specific qubit (0).\n"
msgstr "        Contoh ini menunjukkan cara mendapatkan semula ciri Backend yang berlaku pada masa kerja dilaksanakan, termasuk masa $T_1$/$T_2$ dan kadar ralat untuk Qubit tertentu (0).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Deprecated provider packages\">\n"
"            `service.jobs()` also returns jobs run from the deprecated `qiskit-ibm-provider` package. Jobs submitted by the older (also deprecated) `qiskit-ibmq-provider` package are no longer available.\n"
"        </Admonition>\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Retrieve backend properties on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        You can see calibration data for the backend at the time of job execution, as well as at job creation.\n"
"        1. Go to the [Workloads page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads)\n"
"        2. Click a workload to open its Details page\n"
"        3. Under Quantum computer, click View calibration history\n"
"        4. Use the dropdown menu to change from viewing the data \"At job execution start\" to \"At job creation\"\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Pakej penyedia yang dinyahaktifkan\">\n"
"            `service.jobs()` juga mengembalikan kerja yang dijalankan daripada pakej `qiskit-ibm-provider` yang telah dinyahaktifkan. Kerja yang dihantar oleh pakej `qiskit-ibmq-provider` yang lebih lama (juga telah dinyahaktifkan) tidak lagi tersedia.\n"
"        </Admonition>\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Dapatkan semula ciri Backend pada IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Anda boleh melihat data kalibrasi untuk Backend pada masa pelaksanaan kerja, serta pada masa penciptaan kerja.\n"
"        1. Pergi ke [halaman Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads)\n"
"        2. Klik beban kerja untuk membuka halaman Details-nya\n"
"        3. Di bawah Quantum computer, klik View calibration history\n"
"        4. Gunakan menu lungsur untuk menukar daripada melihat data \"At job execution start\" kepada \"At job creation\"\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cancel a job {#cancel-a-job}"
msgstr "Batalkan kerja {#cancel-a-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cancel a job that is queued or running. Once a job is canceled, it cannot be resumed.\n"
msgstr "Batalkan kerja yang sedang dalam giliran atau berjalan. Setelah kerja dibatalkan, ia tidak boleh disambung semula.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Cancel with Qiskit\">\n"
"        Use the `job.cancel()` method to cancel a job programmatically.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Batal dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Gunakan kaedah `job.cancel()` untuk membatalkan kerja secara programatik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Cancel on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        1. **From the workloads table**: Click the overflow menu at the end of the row for the workload you want to cancel, and select **Cancel**.\n"
"        2. **From the job details page**: Click on the workload to open its details page, use the **Actions** dropdown at the top, and select **Cancel**.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Batal pada IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        1. **Daripada jadual beban kerja**: Klik menu limpahan di hujung baris untuk beban kerja yang anda ingin batalkan, dan pilih **Cancel**.\n"
"        2. **Daripada halaman butiran kerja**: Klik pada beban kerja untuk membuka halaman butirannya, gunakan menu lungsur **Actions** di bahagian atas, dan pilih **Cancel**.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

