"- Review the [`QiskitRuntimeService` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service) for additional job management methods.\n"
"- Explore [execution modes](/guides/execution-modes) to understand batch and session workload types.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"- Semak [rujukan API `QiskitRuntimeService`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service) untuk kaedah pengurusan kerja tambahan.\n"
"- Terokai [mod pelaksanaan](/guides/execution-modes) untuk memahami jenis beban kerja kumpulan dan Session.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
